flowchart TD
    Start[User runs src/main.py] --> Mode{Which input?}

    Mode -->|Structured profile| Score[score_song: genre/mood/energy/acousticness rules]
    Score --> RankA[recommend_songs: rank by score]
    RankA --> OutA[Top-k songs + rule-based explanation]

    Mode -->|Free-text query, e.g. 'calm songs for studying'| Retrieve[Retrieve: SongIndex.search - TF-IDF over song catalog]
    Retrieve --> Retrieved[(Top-k retrieved songs)]
    Retrieved --> Generate[Generate: Gemini explains picks using ONLY retrieved songs]
    Generate --> Guard{Guardrail: check_grounding}
    Guard -->|Pass: mentions a retrieved song, no invented song| OutB[Use AI explanation]
    Guard -->|Fail or AI unavailable| Fallback[Fallback: deterministic template from retrieved songs]
    Fallback --> OutB

    OutA --> Log[Log run to logs/app.log]
    OutB --> Log
    Log --> End[Print result to console]
